<title>ESTONIA: LATE START TO TRADE ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>LATE START TO TRADE ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on the Tallinn bourse started 30 minutes late on Thursday morning due to technical problems, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>&quot;Trade was delayed by technical problems,&quot; managing director Helo Meigas told Reuters.</p>
<p>The stock exchange internet site is also down today and it is not known when it will be in order again, she added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
